Description:
Stubs out a new service. Pass the service name, either camel case or snake case,
and an optional list of its methods as arguments.

It generates service class in `app/services` and spec class in `spec/services`.

Example:
  rails generate service MailerModule::Mailer send receive

This will create:
  app/services/mailer_module/mailer_service.rb
  spec/services/mailer_module/mailer_service_spec.rb
